  "portal_description": "Red Hat Gluster Storage Web Administration includes a fully automated setup based on Ansible and provides deep metrics and insights into active Gluster storage pools by using the Grafana platform. Red Hat Gluster Storage Web Administration provides a dashboard view which allows an administrator to get a view of overall gluster health in terms of hosts, volumes, bricks, and other components of GlusterFS.\n\nThis enhancement update adds the Red Hat Gluster Storage Web Administration packages to Red Hat Gluster Storage 3.3.1 with the following features: \n\n* Monitoring dashboards for Clusters, Hosts, Volumes, and Bricks\n* Top-level list views of Clusters, Hosts, and Volumes\n* SNMPv3 Configuration and alerting\n* User Management\n* Importing Gluster cluster\n\nAll users of Red Hat Gluster Storage who require Red Hat Gluster Storage Web Administration should install the new package.",
